# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local development (wrangler dev).
# This file is NOT committed to git.

# Enable localhost CORS for development
DEV_MODE=1

# Optional: server-side key for PIN / pattern hashes; generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`
# (PowerShell has no openssl — use: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))")
# Unset = v1 hashes, everything still works. Only local PIN records written WITH a pepper
# answer 503 VERIFY_UNAVAILABLE once it is removed or changed: delete that verify: record and set the PIN again.
# VERIFY_PEPPER=
